msgid "All the Jetty binaries are available in Ventura and Sonoma using the"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:5
msgid ""
"[Homebrew package manager](https://brew.sh/). After installing Homebrew, "
"Gazebo Jetty can be installed running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:7
msgid ""
"brew tap osrf/simulation\n"
"brew trust osrf/simulation\n"
"brew install gz-jetty\n"
